{title: Mone Pore Sei Rater Kotha}
{artist: Warfaze}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G]Mone [Bm]pore [C]shei [D]raater kotha [G],        Tumi [Bm]aami nodi [C]teere [D]ekaa boshe [G]
Koto je [Bm]gaan koto je,        [C]shoor koto je [D]kothaa [G]
Mone [Bm]pore ki to [C]maaro,        Bolo naa [G]amaae [Bm]tumi bolo
[C]naa... [D]hmm-hmm,        Bolo naa [G]amaae [Bm]tumi bolo
[C]naa... [D]hmm-hmm,        [G]Mone [Bm]pore [C]shei [D]deener kothaa [G]
