Tumi ki [Bm]taa jaa [C]no.. na,        Bolo naa [G]amaae [Bm]tumi bolo
[C]naa... [D]hmm-hmm,        Bolo naa [G]amaae [Bm]tumi bolo
[C]naa... [D]hmm-hmm,        [C]Jaani [D]aami tumi je [G]amaar
[C]Toboo [D]keno dishe [Am]hara,        [C]Bhaabi [D]aami tumi je [G]paashe
[C]Tobu [D]keno aacho [Am]dure,        Mone [G]pore....
[C]Jaani [D]aami emoni [G]jibon,        [C]Toboo [D]jaage mone [Am]aasha
[C]Bhore [D]jaabe shopone [G]jibon,        [C]Jodi [D]tumi thaako [Am]paashe
[G]Mone [Bm]pore [C]shei [D]raater kothaa [G],        Tumi [Bm]aami nodi [C]teere [D]ekaa boshe [G]
Koto je [Bm]gaan koto je,        [C]shoor koto je [D]kothaa [G] ...
